<title>USA: US Mint buys 241,000 kg nickel at avg $7.3415/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 241,000 kg nickel at avg $7.3415/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Thursday that it bought a total of 241,000 kg of nickel from two firms at an average price of $7.3415 per kg.</p>
<p>The Mint bought 124,000 kg of nickel from Ore &amp; Chemical Co for $7.3051 per kg, and it bought 117,000 kg of nickel from Wolverine Metal Co for $7.3801 per kg.</p>
</text>
